  "label": "Gene Wilder is mapped as a 'special snowflake'",
  "description": "The text 'must be hard being a special snowflake' is juxtaposed with Gene Wilder's image, implying that he is being mocked as a 'special snowflake'. This is an analogical mapping where the textual concept of 'special snowflake' (a derogatory term for someone overly sensitive) is projected onto Gene Wilder, who is visually depicted as cheerful and engaged in signing a book. The mapping is based on the visual-textual juxtaposition and the meme's intent to ridicule sensitivity.",
